{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012wX4B48739MmbrQi2dq5r2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t@AGENTS.md\n2\t\n3\t# Claude Code notes\n4\t\n5\t- `node --version` should print v24.22.2 (the SessionStart hook puts it first on PATH); if not, run\n6\t  `bash scripts/setup.sh`.\n7\t- **Cloud container.** Its Chromium is at `/opt/pw-browsers/chromium` (`$CHROMIUM_PATH` when set): Chrome for Testing\n8\t  153.0.8010.12, tools/deps.json's pin and GitHub's full run's (WP U-8). Never run\n9\t  `playwright install`. Never disable TLS verification for the environment's proxy. If the sources cannot be\n10\t  resolved, the session must reach GitHub (both are public) or include `michaelcrosato/my-3d2dge` and\n11\t  `michaelcrosato/shardfall`: escalate once (PLAN.md §11.5).\n12\t- **Long suites** (`npm run e2e`, `node x ci --local --full`) run as background tasks, and only where AGENTS.md\n13\t  allows them (ADR-0023). Read `out/**/report.json` instead of scrolling their output.\n14\t- **API questions** are answered by the pinned packages' own types and sources in `node_modules` (three.js's `src/`\n15\t  carries its JSDoc), never by memory of another release: `tsc` rejects a name the pinned release lacks.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"21849288-0c8f-4994-9d0f-3ff83c647ec0","uuid":"82ca09eb-b6cf-42de-94e6-b0b9c3fe3096","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:22:55.838Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211902__xe334ec/work/_scratch/my-3dge/CLAUDE.md","content":"@AGENTS.md\n\n# Claude Code notes\n\n- `node --version` should print v24.22.2 (the SessionStart hook puts it first on PATH); if not, run\n  `bash scripts/setup.sh`.\n- **Cloud container.** Its Chromium is at `/opt/pw-browsers/chromium` (`$CHROMIUM_PATH` when set): Chrome for Testing\n  153.0.8010.12, tools/deps.json's pin and GitHub's full run's (WP U-8). Never run\n  `playwright install`. Never disable TLS verification for the environment's proxy. If the sources cannot be\n  resolved, the session must reach GitHub (both are public) or include `michaelcrosato/my-3d2dge` and\n  `michaelcrosato/shardfall`: escalate once (PLAN.md §11.5).\n- **Long suites** (`npm run e2e`, `node x ci --local --full`) run as background tasks, and only where AGENTS.md\n  allows them (ADR-0023). Read `out/**/report.json` instead of scrolling their output.\n- **API questions** are answered by the pinned packages' own types and sources in `node_modules` (three.js's `src/`\n  carries its JSDoc), never by memory of another release: `tsc` rejects a name the pinned release lacks.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012wX4B48739MmbrQi2dq5r2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
