{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgj9FZzwXtcvnuk79qVum","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01M7b4nbMtSpy1T8anzQDeBf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211902__xe334ec/work/_scratch/ai-hub; sed -n 1,80p lib/README.md; echo ----; ls lib/kit lib/vendor lib/hub/examples; echo ----; grep -l \"my-3dge\\|my3dge\" -r games --include='*.md' --include='*.json' -l 2>/dev/null | head -20; ls games | wc -l; ls games | head -30","description":"Read hub lib overview and find my-3dge games in the hub"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":36344,"cache_read_input_tokens":44150,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":36344},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"21849288-0c8f-4994-9d0f-3ff83c647ec0","uuid":"8bcd5d62-eb3f-4115-a54d-9e8991042043","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:23:56.948Z","request_id":"req_011Cgj9FZjZwAqcquN9h9NkJ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01M7b4nbMtSpy1T8anzQDeBf":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211902__xe334ec/work/_scratch/ai-hub; sed -n 1,80p lib/README.md; echo ----; ls lib/kit lib/vendor lib/hub/examples; echo ----; grep -l \"my-3dge\\|my3dge\" -r games --include='*.md' --include='*.json' -l 2>/dev/null | head -20; ls games | wc -l; ls games | head -30","description":"Read hub lib overview and find my-3dge games in the hub"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M7b4nbMtSpy1T8anzQDeBf","type":"tool_result","content":"# lib/ — the shared 3D stack\n\nLoaded by games using the shared kit from the site root (`/lib/...`), so one\nupgrade here moves those games together. They reach it through the import map in their `<head>`\n(see `kit/README.md`).\n\n| Folder | What | Source |\n|---|---|---|\n| `three/` | three.js r186 (0.186.1): `three.core.js`, `three.webgpu.js`, `three.tsl.js`, minified; `addons/` = `examples/jsm/` unminified, minus WebGL-only and tooling folders | npm `three@0.186.1` |\n| `rapier/` | Rapier 0.20.0: `rapier-simd.mjs` (from `@dimforge/rapier3d-simd-compat`) and `rapier.mjs` (from `@dimforge/rapier3d-compat`), wasm inlined | npm |\n| `kit/` | our foundation: boot, renderer, settings and quality tiers, input and touch controls, physics loader, post-processing, sized points, the settings panel | this repo |\n| `vendor/` | immutable versioned package shelf: Three.js 0.180.0–0.186.1 and all 12 official Rapier variants at 0.19.3, 0.20.0 and 0.21.0 | npm, with integrity-checked downloads; see `vendor/README.md` |\n\nThe versioned shelf supports importing older games without migrating their\nrenderer or physics. `pnpm ingest` localizes recognized engine URLs and bare\nimports; copying a game manually still requires its own correct import map.\nThe shared `three/`, `rapier/` and `kit/` paths remain independent of the shelf.\n\n## Upgrading three.js\n\n```bash\nnpm pack three@<version> && tar xzf three-<version>.tgz\nfor f in three.core.js three.webgpu.js three.tsl.js; do\n  npx esbuild package/build/$f --minify --format=esm --target=es2022 --legal-comments=inline --outfile=lib/three/$f\ndone\nrsync -a --delete --exclude-from=lib/three-addons.exclude package/examples/jsm/ lib/three/addons/\n```\n\nThen run `python3 scripts/check3d.py lib/kit/example.html` and a sample of\ngames on both backends, read the three.js migration notes for the revisions\nyou skipped, and update `kit/README.md` if an API moved.\n\n### Local patches\n\n`rsync --delete` above overwrites these; re-apply each one unless the new\nrelease fixes the problem upstream (check with the pipeline count in\n`window.__kit.pipelines`):\n\n- `addons/csm/CSMShadowNode.js`: `_setupFade()` and `_setupStandard()` build\n  their `cameraNear`, `cascades` and `shadowFar` nodes once (`??=` on the\n  instance) instead of on every setup. Otherwise each material build gets a\n  differently named uniform buffer, and every InstancedMesh under cascaded\n  shadows compiles its own shader (Verdant Frontier: 119 pipelines → 27).\n- `three.webgpu.js`, `ViewportTextureNode.getTextureForReference()`: each\n  per-render-target clone of the framebuffer texture gets its own `Source`\n  (`r.source=new t.source.constructor({width:0,height:0})`). Clones shared\n  one image, so a new render target of the same size never re-created its\n  copy texture in the target's format, and transmission or viewport\n  textures failed with \"copyFramebufferToTexture: Source and destination\n  formats do not match\" after a quality switch (Golden Hour).\n\n## Upgrading Rapier\n\nCopy `dist/rapier.mjs` from the `-simd-compat` and `-compat` packages of the\nnew version over `rapier/rapier-simd.mjs` and `rapier/rapier.mjs`, bump\n`physicsInfo.version` in `kit/physics.js`, and re-tune any game whose feel\ndepends on changed defaults.\n----\nlib/hub/examples:\narena.html\nghost.html\nparallel.html\n\nlib/kit:\nREADME.md\nboot.js\nexample.html\ninput.js\ninstancing.js\nloop.js\nphysics.js\npoints.js\npost.js\nrenderer.js\nretro.js\nsettings.js\ntouch.js\nui.js\n\nlib/vendor:\nREADME.md\nextras\nmanifest.json\nrapier\nthree\n----\n2197\n1080-Snowboarding-POWDER-RUSH-Mirror-Lake-2026-09-15-model-unknown.html\n90spcrpg\nA-Bad-Time-for-Earth-AttackoftheTimelord-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261029-1405.html\nA-Little-More-Magic-Master-of-Magic-gpt-6.1-sol-xhigh-20261029-0820.html\nA-Masterful-Mistake-Master-of-Magic-gpt-6-astra-xhigh-20261029-1107.html\nA-Vow-and-Again-Avowed-gpt-6.1-terra-ultra-20261029-1104.html\nA-Vow-of-Moss-Avowed-gpt-6.1-terra-high-20261029-1354.html\nAC3-Neon-Skies-Mach-and-Mischief-2026-09-24-model-unknown\nAce-Combat-SKY-RASCAL-Breakwater-2026-09-15-model-unknown\nAero-Vanguard-Lylat-Protocol-Star-Fox-gemini-4-argon-1.00-20261015-2109.html\nAether-Wing-Star-Fox-gemini-4-argon-1.00-20261015-2117.html\nAfter-Hours-Physical-World.html\nAfterburner-Aardwolf-Flight-demo-Star-Fox-64-gpt-6.1-sol-medium-20261021-0037.html\nAfterhours-Alpha-2-Street-Fighter-Alpha-2-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261029-0819.html\nAliceInJabberland-AlicesAdventuresInWonderland-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261101-1409.html\nAlicesAdventuresInPonderland-AlicesAdventuresInWonderland-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261101-1409.html\nAlien-Bloodstar-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6-astra-xhigh-20261029-1126.html\nAlien-Firebrand-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6.1-sol-xhigh-20261029-0843.html\nAlien-Shoulder-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261029-0820.html\nAlien-Solstice-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6.1-terra-xhigh-20261029-0939.html\nAlien-Stormbringer-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261029-0913.html\nAlien-Wonder-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6-astra-ultra-20261029-1056.html\nAlienSolidEar-AlienSoldier-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261029-0702.html\nAmber-Wrath-Golden-Axe-II-gpt-6-astra-ultra-20261029-1047.html\nAmperion-IB-Neon-Verge-inFAMOUS-muse-wonder-1-unknown-20261017-1037.html\nAnchovy-1800-Anno-1800-claude-sonnet-5.5-unknown-20261017-1622.html\nAnno-Pancake-Anno-1800-claude-haiku-5.5-medium-20261017-1926.html\nApex-Picnic-Daybreak-Motor-Club-Gran-Turismo-5-Prologue-2007-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261024-0935.html\nArc-the-Ladle-Arc-the-Lad-claude-sonnet-5.5-unknown-20261017-1919.html\nArc-the-Landlubber-Arc-the-Lad-claude-haiku-5.5-unknown-20261017-1846.html","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"21849288-0c8f-4994-9d0f-3ff83c647ec0","uuid":"d46f574f-ba97-4786-92ff-8f8306ce3166","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:23:57.691Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# lib/ — the shared 3D stack\n\nLoaded by games using the shared kit from the site root (`/lib/...`), so one\nupgrade here moves those games together. They reach it through the import map in their `<head>`\n(see `kit/README.md`).\n\n| Folder | What | Source |\n|---|---|---|\n| `three/` | three.js r186 (0.186.1): `three.core.js`, `three.webgpu.js`, `three.tsl.js`, minified; `addons/` = `examples/jsm/` unminified, minus WebGL-only and tooling folders | npm `three@0.186.1` |\n| `rapier/` | Rapier 0.20.0: `rapier-simd.mjs` (from `@dimforge/rapier3d-simd-compat`) and `rapier.mjs` (from `@dimforge/rapier3d-compat`), wasm inlined | npm |\n| `kit/` | our foundation: boot, renderer, settings and quality tiers, input and touch controls, physics loader, post-processing, sized points, the settings panel | this repo |\n| `vendor/` | immutable versioned package shelf: Three.js 0.180.0–0.186.1 and all 12 official Rapier variants at 0.19.3, 0.20.0 and 0.21.0 | npm, with integrity-checked downloads; see `vendor/README.md` |\n\nThe versioned shelf supports importing older games without migrating their\nrenderer or physics. `pnpm ingest` localizes recognized engine URLs and bare\nimports; copying a game manually still requires its own correct import map.\nThe shared `three/`, `rapier/` and `kit/` paths remain independent of the shelf.\n\n## Upgrading three.js\n\n```bash\nnpm pack three@<version> && tar xzf three-<version>.tgz\nfor f in three.core.js three.webgpu.js three.tsl.js; do\n  npx esbuild package/build/$f --minify --format=esm --target=es2022 --legal-comments=inline --outfile=lib/three/$f\ndone\nrsync -a --delete --exclude-from=lib/three-addons.exclude package/examples/jsm/ lib/three/addons/\n```\n\nThen run `python3 scripts/check3d.py lib/kit/example.html` and a sample of\ngames on both backends, read the three.js migration notes for the revisions\nyou skipped, and update `kit/README.md` if an API moved.\n\n### Local patches\n\n`rsync --delete` above overwrites these; re-apply each one unless the new\nrelease fixes the problem upstream (check with the pipeline count in\n`window.__kit.pipelines`):\n\n- `addons/csm/CSMShadowNode.js`: `_setupFade()` and `_setupStandard()` build\n  their `cameraNear`, `cascades` and `shadowFar` nodes once (`??=` on the\n  instance) instead of on every setup. Otherwise each material build gets a\n  differently named uniform buffer, and every InstancedMesh under cascaded\n  shadows compiles its own shader (Verdant Frontier: 119 pipelines → 27).\n- `three.webgpu.js`, `ViewportTextureNode.getTextureForReference()`: each\n  per-render-target clone of the framebuffer texture gets its own `Source`\n  (`r.source=new t.source.constructor({width:0,height:0})`). Clones shared\n  one image, so a new render target of the same size never re-created its\n  copy texture in the target's format, and transmission or viewport\n  textures failed with \"copyFramebufferToTexture: Source and destination\n  formats do not match\" after a quality switch (Golden Hour).\n\n## Upgrading Rapier\n\nCopy `dist/rapier.mjs` from the `-simd-compat` and `-compat` packages of the\nnew version over `rapier/rapier-simd.mjs` and `rapier/rapier.mjs`, bump\n`physicsInfo.version` in `kit/physics.js`, and re-tune any game whose feel\ndepends on changed defaults.\n----\nlib/hub/examples:\narena.html\nghost.html\nparallel.html\n\nlib/kit:\nREADME.md\nboot.js\nexample.html\ninput.js\ninstancing.js\nloop.js\nphysics.js\npoints.js\npost.js\nrenderer.js\nretro.js\nsettings.js\ntouch.js\nui.js\n\nlib/vendor:\nREADME.md\nextras\nmanifest.json\nrapier\nthree\n----\n2197\n1080-Snowboarding-POWDER-RUSH-Mirror-Lake-2026-09-15-model-unknown.html\n90spcrpg\nA-Bad-Time-for-Earth-AttackoftheTimelord-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261029-1405.html\nA-Little-More-Magic-Master-of-Magic-gpt-6.1-sol-xhigh-20261029-0820.html\nA-Masterful-Mistake-Master-of-Magic-gpt-6-astra-xhigh-20261029-1107.html\nA-Vow-and-Again-Avowed-gpt-6.1-terra-ultra-20261029-1104.html\nA-Vow-of-Moss-Avowed-gpt-6.1-terra-high-20261029-1354.html\nAC3-Neon-Skies-Mach-and-Mischief-2026-09-24-model-unknown\nAce-Combat-SKY-RASCAL-Breakwater-2026-09-15-model-unknown\nAero-Vanguard-Lylat-Protocol-Star-Fox-gemini-4-argon-1.00-20261015-2109.html\nAether-Wing-Star-Fox-gemini-4-argon-1.00-20261015-2117.html\nAfter-Hours-Physical-World.html\nAfterburner-Aardwolf-Flight-demo-Star-Fox-64-gpt-6.1-sol-medium-20261021-0037.html\nAfterhours-Alpha-2-Street-Fighter-Alpha-2-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261029-0819.html\nAliceInJabberland-AlicesAdventuresInWonderland-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261101-1409.html\nAlicesAdventuresInPonderland-AlicesAdventuresInWonderland-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261101-1409.html\nAlien-Bloodstar-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6-astra-xhigh-20261029-1126.html\nAlien-Firebrand-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6.1-sol-xhigh-20261029-0843.html\nAlien-Shoulder-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261029-0820.html\nAlien-Solstice-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6.1-terra-xhigh-20261029-0939.html\nAlien-Stormbringer-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261029-0913.html\nAlien-Wonder-Alien-Soldier-gpt-6-astra-ultra-20261029-1056.html\nAlienSolidEar-AlienSoldier-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261029-0702.html\nAmber-Wrath-Golden-Axe-II-gpt-6-astra-ultra-20261029-1047.html\nAmperion-IB-Neon-Verge-inFAMOUS-muse-wonder-1-unknown-20261017-1037.html\nAnchovy-1800-Anno-1800-claude-sonnet-5.5-unknown-20261017-1622.html\nAnno-Pancake-Anno-1800-claude-haiku-5.5-medium-20261017-1926.html\nApex-Picnic-Daybreak-Motor-Club-Gran-Turismo-5-Prologue-2007-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261024-0935.html\nArc-the-Ladle-Arc-the-Lad-claude-sonnet-5.5-unknown-20261017-1919.html\nArc-the-Landlubber-Arc-the-Lad-claude-haiku-5.5-unknown-20261017-1846.html","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01M7b4nbMtSpy1T8anzQDeBf","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
