{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0174tzgVMUVYuKxEAF3jsN5x","type":"tool_result","content":"[… earlier output omitted; full output: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211902__xe334ec/tmp/claude-1000/-home-micha-dev-cc-matrix-runs-claude-opus-5-5-max-plan-v2--20261104-211902--xe334ec-work/21849288-0c8f-4994-9d0f-3ff83c647ec0/tasks/bq12jvffe.output]\nThe Set column names the catalog a library's clips are described in (`catalogs/<set>.json`). 100STYLE's clips are in\nseven sets, `STYLE100` and `STYLE100_BACK`, `_BACKRUN`, `_IDLE`, `_RUN`, `_SIDE` and `_SIDERUN`, described by seven\ncatalogs, `catalogs/100style.json` and `catalogs/100style_<gait>.json`: shardfall names the family `100style` (each\ncatalog's `\"$library\"`), and the sets `STYLE100…` because a set's name must not start with a digit.\n\n## Quaternius Universal Animation Library 1 and 2\n\n- **What:** every free clip of both libraries, as Quaternius exports them in version 2 of their Standard editions\n  (June 2026), converted by shardfall's importer at `fa2dab6`: 102 clips, each clip in place and, for the clips that\n  travel, its root-motion twin `<clip>_RM` (a loop takes its `speed` from the twin). The QUATERNIUS set holds them and\n  `Punch_Enter`, which version 2 dropped, kept from my-3d2dge's conversion of version 1 (`\"via\": \"v1\"`; the other 102\n  say `\"via\": \"shardfall\"`): 103 clips. Version 1's set (88 clips, my-3d2dge's) is gone; 87 of its clips are in\n  version 2 (tests/unit/data/anim/shardfall.test.ts compares them).\n- **License:** CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication); the legal code is in `LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt`. No credit is\n  required. The sets credit \"Universal Animation Library 1 and 2 by Quaternius (quaternius.com)\" anyway.\n- **Files:** `UAL1_Standard.glb` and `UAL1_Standard_RM.glb`, `UAL2_Standard.glb` and `UAL2_Standard_RM.glb` (rig:\n  Unreal-style names), downloaded from the two pages in the table. `Punch_Enter` came from version 1's\n  `AnimationLibrary_Godot_Standard.glb` (rig: Rigify `DEF-` bones). The set's `body`, the mannequin's segments and\n  bands, was measured by my-3d2dge from version 1's mesh.\n\nCC-BY-4.0.txt\nCC0-1.0.txt\nCMU.txt\nCommand did not complete within its 240s timeout and was moved to the background (ID: bq12jvffe). Output is being written to: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211902__xe334ec/tmp/claude-1000/-home-micha-dev-cc-matrix-runs-claude-opus-5-5-max-plan-v2--20261104-211902--xe334ec-work/21849288-0c8f-4994-9d0f-3ff83c647ec0/tasks/bq12jvffe.output. You will be notified when it completes. If it is still running after 10m in the background, it will be stopped and you will be notified. It is running now: do not start a second copy while it runs. If it is no longer needed, stop it with TaskStop. To check interim output, use Read on that file path.\nSession cwd remains /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211902__xe334ec/work/_scratch/my-3dge; directory changes made by the backgrounded command do not apply to subsequent commands.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"21849288-0c8f-4994-9d0f-3ff83c647ec0","uuid":"1097255b-ea1c-4864-8bbd-b870ee630fb8","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:03:17.612Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"[… earlier output omitted; full output: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211902__xe334ec/tmp/claude-1000/-home-micha-dev-cc-matrix-runs-claude-opus-5-5-max-plan-v2--20261104-211902--xe334ec-work/21849288-0c8f-4994-9d0f-3ff83c647ec0/tasks/bq12jvffe.output]\nThe Set column names the catalog a library's clips are described in (`catalogs/<set>.json`). 100STYLE's clips are in\nseven sets, `STYLE100` and `STYLE100_BACK`, `_BACKRUN`, `_IDLE`, `_RUN`, `_SIDE` and `_SIDERUN`, described by seven\ncatalogs, `catalogs/100style.json` and `catalogs/100style_<gait>.json`: shardfall names the family `100style` (each\ncatalog's `\"$library\"`), and the sets `STYLE100…` because a set's name must not start with a digit.\n\n## Quaternius Universal Animation Library 1 and 2\n\n- **What:** every free clip of both libraries, as Quaternius exports them in version 2 of their Standard editions\n  (June 2026), converted by shardfall's importer at `fa2dab6`: 102 clips, each clip in place and, for the clips that\n  travel, its root-motion twin `<clip>_RM` (a loop takes its `speed` from the twin). The QUATERNIUS set holds them and\n  `Punch_Enter`, which version 2 dropped, kept from my-3d2dge's conversion of version 1 (`\"via\": \"v1\"`; the other 102\n  say `\"via\": \"shardfall\"`): 103 clips. Version 1's set (88 clips, my-3d2dge's) is gone; 87 of its clips are in\n  version 2 (tests/unit/data/anim/shardfall.test.ts compares them).\n- **License:** CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication); the legal code is in `LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt`. No credit is\n  required. The sets credit \"Universal Animation Library 1 and 2 by Quaternius (quaternius.com)\" anyway.\n- **Files:** `UAL1_Standard.glb` and `UAL1_Standard_RM.glb`, `UAL2_Standard.glb` and `UAL2_Standard_RM.glb` (rig:\n  Unreal-style names), downloaded from the two pages in the table. `Punch_Enter` came from version 1's\n  `AnimationLibrary_Godot_Standard.glb` (rig: Rigify `DEF-` bones). The set's `body`, the mannequin's segments and\n  bands, was measured by my-3d2dge from version 1's mesh.\n\nCC-BY-4.0.txt\nCC0-1.0.txt\nCMU.txt","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"backgroundTaskId":"bq12jvffe","timedOutAfterMs":240000,"backgroundCwdHint":"Session cwd remains /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211902__xe334ec/work/_scratch/my-3dge; directory changes made by the backgrounded command do not apply to subsequent commands."},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0174tzgVMUVYuKxEAF3jsN5x","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"