at `fa2dab6` (`shardfall:crates/pav_tools/src/mocap/`); then repacked\n  here one file per clip (tools/anim/shardfall.ts). 878 loops in seven sets: forward walks (`STYLE100`, 98), backward\n  walks and runs (`STYLE100_BACK`, `STYLE100_BACKRUN`, 98 each), standing (`STYLE100_IDLE`, 98), runs\n  (`STYLE100_RUN`, 98), and sidesteps and sideways runs each way (`STYLE100_SIDE`, `STYLE100_SIDERUN`, 194 each).\n  The styles that cannot loop in place (the spins; the drags that lead with the dragged leg) are left out, each with\n19:| `100STYLE` | 100STYLE Dataset (Mason, Starke and Komura, 2022) | 100STYLE | CC BY 4.0 | [CC-BY-4.0.txt](LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt) | https://zenodo.org/records/8127870 | `100STYLE.zip`: `100STYLE/<Style>/<Style>_<Gait>.bvh`, `Dataset_List.csv`, `Frame_Cuts.c\n21:The Set column names the catalog a library's clips are described in (`catalogs/<set>.json`). 100STYLE's clips are in\n22:seven sets, `STYLE100` and `STYLE100_BACK`, `_BACKRUN`, `_IDLE`, `_RUN`, `_SIDE` and `_SIDERUN`, described by seven\n23:catalogs, `catalogs/100style.json` and `catalogs/100style_<gait>.json`: shardfall names the family `100style` (each\n24:catalog's `\"$library\"`), and the sets `STYLE100…` because a set's name must not start with a digit.\n RUN  v4.1.12 /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211902__xe334ec/work/_scratch/probe2\nstdout | labs/game/probe/act.test.ts > runs\n[{\"name\":\"game.start\",\"from\":\"scene\",\"changes\":\"sim\"},{\"name\":\"freeze\",\"from\":\"engine\",\"changes\":\"sim\",\"help\":\"Freezes the AI: the step skips the phase ai, and the actors and crowd agents it drives stand.\",\"args\":\"on = true\"},{\"name\":\"god\",\"from\":\"engine\",\"changes\":\"sim\",\"help\":\"Makes an entity take\nrun -> {\"name\":\"game.start\",\"tick\":3}\n{\"seed\":5,\"nextId\":2,\"hz\":60,\"entities\":[{\"id\":1,\"flow\":{\"mode\":\"pond\",\"n\":1}}],\"timers\":{\"ticks\":5,\"nextId\":1,\"timers\":[]},\"settings\":{},\"rng\":{}}\ndefaul